# nanopb options for c2c.proto
#
# NFCData.data carries a raw NFC APDU (command or response). EMV short APDUs are
# <= 256 B; we allow 512 B of headroom for extended-length / multi-block frames.
# nanopb emits a fixed-size buffer (pb_byte_t data[512] + size_t), so this bounds
# per-message RAM. Raise only if you observe truncation against a real terminal.
#
# The leading '*' wildcard matches the fully-qualified name
# (de.tu_darmstadt.seemoo.nfcgate.network.c2c.NFCData.data) regardless of package.
*NFCData.data  max_size:512
